const readerInlineHtml=text=>String(text).replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;").replace(/\[font=(sans|helvetica|serif|times|song|kai|hei|mono)\]([\s\S]*?)\[\/font\]/g,(_,font,value)=>`<span style="font-family:${readerFontStacks[font]}">${value}</span>`).replace(/\[size=(12|14|16|18|24|32)\]([\s\S]*?)\[\/size\]/g,'<span style="font-size:$1px">$2</span>').replace(/\[color=(#[0-9a-fA-F]{6})\]([\s\S]*?)\[\/color\]/g,'<span style="color:$1">$2</span>').replace(/\[bg=(#[0-9a-fA-F]{6})\]([\s\S]*?)\[\/bg\]/g,'<span style="background-color:$1;padding:.08em .18em">$2</span>').replace(/\[([^\]]+)\]\((https?:\/\/[^)]+)\)/g,'<a href="$2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">$1</a>').replace(/\*\*([^*]+)\*\*/g,"<strong>$1</strong>").replace(/_([^_]+)_/g,"<em>$1</em>");
function RichText({text="",blurred=false}){const parts=text.split(/(!\[[^\]]*\]\([^)]+\)|\n\s*\n)/g).filter(value=>value&&!/^\n+$/.test(value));return <div className="richtext" style={{filter:blurred?"blur(4px)":"none",userSelect:blurred?"none":"auto"}}>{parts.map((part,index)=>{const image=part.match(/^!\[([^\]]*)\]\((.+)\)$/s);if(image)return <figure key={index}><img src={image[2]} alt={image[1]} loading="lazy" decoding="async"/>{image[1]&&image[1]!=="image"&&<figcaption>{image[1]}</figcaption>}</figure>;const value=part.trim();if(/^---+$/.test(value))return <hr key={index}/>;if(value.startsWith("## "))return <h3 key={index} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(value.slice(3))}}/>;if(value.startsWith("# "))return <h2 key={index} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(value.slice(2))}}/>;if(value.startsWith("> "))return <blockquote key={index} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(value.slice(2))}}/>;const lines=value.split("\n"),unordered=lines.every(line=>line.startsWith("- ")),ordered=lines.every(line=>/^\d+\. /.test(line));if(unordered)return <ul key={index}>{lines.map((line,i)=><li key={i} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(line.slice(2))}}/>)}</ul>;if(ordered)return <ol key={index}>{lines.map((line,i)=><li key={i} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(line.replace(/^\d+\. /,""))}}/>)}</ol>;return <p key={index} dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:readerInlineHtml(value).replace(/\n/g,"<br>")}}/>})}</div>}


function Analysis({lang,setLang}){
  const[analysisFile,setAnalysisFile]=useState(null),[analysisQuestion,setAnalysisQuestion]=useState(""),[analysisBusy,setAnalysisBusy]=useState(false),[analysisHistory,setAnalysisHistory]=useState([]),[analysisError,setAnalysisError]=useState(""),[analysisStatus,setAnalysisStatus]=useState("");
  const documentLabels=lang==="zh"?{upload:"上传资料",support:"JPG、PNG、WebP、PDF · 10MB",question:"输入问题",placeholder:"你想了解什么？",analyze:"开始分析",working:"正在分析…",retrying:"连接不稳定，正在重试…",remove:"移除",replace:"更换",newAnalysis:"重新分析",follow:"继续提问…",send:"发送",error:"分析失败，请稍后重试。",network:"网络不稳定，请检查连接后重试。",timeout:"分析超时了，请换用较小文件或稍后重试。",busy:"AI 服务暂时繁忙，请稍后重试。",empty:"没有得到有效的分析结果，请重试。",format:"请上传 PDF、JPG、PNG 或 WebP 文件。",size:"文件不能超过 10MB",questionTooLong:"问题不能超过 1200 个字符。"}:lang==="fr"?{upload:"Importer",support:"JPG, PNG, WebP, PDF · 10 Mo",question:"Votre question",placeholder:"Que souhaitez-vous comprendre ?",analyze:"Analyser",working:"Analyse…",retrying:"Connexion instable, nouvelle tentative…",remove:"Supprimer",replace:"Changer",newAnalysis:"Recommencer",follow:"Continuer…",send:"Envoyer",error:"Échec de l’analyse, veuillez réessayer.",network:"Connexion instable, vérifiez votre réseau.",timeout:"L’analyse a expiré. Essayez un fichier plus petit.",busy:"Le service IA est momentanément occupé.",empty:"Aucun résultat valide. Veuillez réessayer.",format:"Importez un fichier PDF, JPG, PNG ou WebP.",size:"10 Mo maximum",questionTooLong:"La question ne peut pas dépasser 1200 caractères."}:{upload:"Upload material",support:"JPG, PNG, WebP, PDF · 10MB",question:"Your question",placeholder:"What would you like to understand?",analyze:"Analyze",working:"Analyzing…",retrying:"Connection unstable, retrying…",remove:"Remove",replace:"Replace",newAnalysis:"Start over",follow:"Ask a follow-up…",send:"Send",error:"Analysis failed. Please try again.",network:"The connection is unstable. Check your network and retry.",timeout:"The analysis timed out. Try a smaller file or retry later.",busy:"The AI service is temporarily busy.",empty:"No usable result was returned. Please retry.",format:"Upload a PDF, JPG, PNG or WebP file.",size:"Files must be 10MB or smaller.",questionTooLong:"Your question must be 1,200 characters or fewer."};
  const chooseDocument=event=>{const file=event.target.files?.[0];setAnalysisHistory([]);setAnalysisError("");setAnalysisStatus("");if(!file)return;const extension=String(file.name||"").toLowerCase().split(".").pop();const accepted=file.type==="application/pdf"||file.type.startsWith("image/")||["pdf","jpg","jpeg","png","webp"].includes(extension);if(file.size>10*1024*1024){setAnalysisFile(null);setAnalysisError(documentLabels.size);event.target.value="";return}if(!accepted){setAnalysisFile(null);setAnalysisError(documentLabels.format);event.target.value="";return}setAnalysisFile(file)};
  const resetAnalysis=()=>{setAnalysisFile(null);setAnalysisQuestion("");setAnalysisHistory([]);setAnalysisError("");setAnalysisStatus("")};
  const parseResponse=async response=>{const text=await response.text();let result={};try{result=JSON.parse(text)}catch{}if(!response.ok){const failure=Error(result.detail||result.error||`HTTP ${response.status}`);failure.status=response.status;throw failure}const answer=String(result.answer||"").trim();if(!answer){const failure=Error("empty");failure.code="empty";throw failure}return answer};
  const errorLabel=error=>{if(error?.code==="timeout")return documentLabels.timeout;if(error?.code==="empty")return documentLabels.empty;if(error?.status===413)return documentLabels.size;if(error?.status===415)return documentLabels.format;if(error?.status===429)return documentLabels.busy;if(error?.status>=500)return documentLabels.busy;return documentLabels.network};
  const analyzeDocument=async()=>{if(!analysisFile||!analysisQuestion.trim()||analysisBusy)return;const asked=analysisQuestion.trim();if(asked.length>1200){setAnalysisError(documentLabels.questionTooLong);return}setAnalysisBusy(true);setAnalysisError("");setAnalysisStatus(documentLabels.working);const data=new FormData();data.append("file",analysisFile,analysisFile.name);data.append("question",asked);data.append("language",lang);data.append("context",analysisHistory.slice(-4).map(item=>`Q: ${item.question}\nA: ${item.answer}`).join("\n\n"));const started=Date.now();let finalError=null;for(let attempt=0;attempt<3;attempt++){const controller=new AbortController(),remaining=Math.max(5000,70000-(Date.now()-started)),timer=setTimeout(()=>controller.abort(),Math.min(30000,remaining));try{if(attempt>0)setAnalysisStatus(`${documentLabels.retrying} ${attempt}/2`);const response=await fetch("/api/document-analysis",{method:"POST",body:data,signal:controller.signal});const answer=await parseResponse(response);setAnalysisHistory(items=>[...items,{question:asked,answer}]);setAnalysisQuestion("");return}catch(error){finalError=error;if(error?.name==="AbortError")finalError.code="timeout";const retryable=!finalError.status||finalError.status===408||finalError.status===429||finalError.status>=500||finalError.code==="timeout";if(attempt<2&&retryable){await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,700*(attempt+1)));continue}break}finally{clearTimeout(timer)}}setAnalysisError(errorLabel(finalError))};
  return <div className="xart-analysis-home">
    <main className={`xart-analysis-main ${analysisHistory.length?"has-result":""}`}><section className="xart-analysis-workspace">
        {!analysisFile?<label className="xart-analysis-drop"><span><Upload size={24}/></span><b>{documentLabels.upload}</b><small>{documentLabels.support}</small><input type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" onChange={chooseDocument}/></label>:<div className="xart-analysis-file"><span>{analysisFile.type==="application/pdf"||analysisFile.name?.toLowerCase().endsWith(".pdf")?<FileText size={22}/>:<ImageIcon size={22}/>}</span><div><b>{analysisFile.name}</b><small>{(analysisFile.size/1024/1024).toFixed(2)} MB</small></div><label>{documentLabels.replace}<input type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" onChange={chooseDocument}/></label><button onClick={resetAnalysis} aria-label={documentLabels.remove}><X size={17}/></button></div>}
        {!analysisHistory.length&&<><label className="xart-analysis-question"><b>{documentLabels.question}</b><textarea rows="4" value={analysisQuestion} onChange={event=>setAnalysisQuestion(event.target.value)} placeholder={documentLabels.placeholder}/></label><button className="xart-analysis-submit" disabled={!analysisFile||!analysisQuestion.trim()||analysisBusy} onClick={analyzeDocument}>{analysisBusy?<span className="xart-analysis-spinner"/>:<Sparkles size={16}/>} {analysisBusy?documentLabels.working:documentLabels.analyze}</button></>}
        {analysisStatus&&<p className="xart-analysis-status" role="status">{analysisStatus}</p>}{analysisError&&<p className="xart-analysis-error" role="alert">{analysisError}</p>}
      </section>
      {analysisHistory.map((item,index)=><section className="xart-analysis-result" key={`${index}-${item.question}`}><div><span><Sparkles size={15}/></span><b>{item.question}</b>{index===0&&<button onClick={resetAnalysis}>{documentLabels.newAnalysis}</button>}</div><p>{item.answer}</p></section>)}
      {analysisHistory.length>0&&<div className="xart-analysis-follow"><input value={analysisQuestion} onChange={event=>setAnalysisQuestion(event.target.value)} onKeyDown={event=>{if(event.key==="Enter"&&!event.shiftKey){event.preventDefault();analyzeDocument()}}} placeholder={documentLabels.follow}/><button disabled={!analysisQuestion.trim()||analysisBusy} onClick={analyzeDocument}>{analysisBusy?<span className="xart-analysis-spinner"/>:<Send size={15}/>}<span>{documentLabels.send}</span></button></div>}
    </main>
  </div>
}
